  "fullContentHtml": "\n<h1 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-e52a0102 gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Lekhpal&nbsp;Answer Key 2026</h1>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-659bd175\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-a344b6f7\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-31d42cf5\">\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c57ae0af gb-headline-text\">Post Date: <time class=\"entry-date published\" datetime=\"2026-05-26T20:12:16+05:30\">May 26, 2026</time></p>\n\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<span class=\"custom-post-time\">8:12 pm</span>\n\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-550ae316 short_Details gb-headline-text\"></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><a href=\"https://upsssc.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Service Selection Commission (UPSSSC)</a>, </strong>has released the <strong>Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;on the <strong>official website</strong> for the recruitment of <strong>Lekhpal Posts.</strong> The&nbsp;<strong>exam</strong> was conducted on <strong>21 May 2026,</strong>&nbsp;and the&nbsp;<strong>last date</strong>&nbsp;to submit the application form was&nbsp;<strong>28 January 2026.</strong>&nbsp;Candidates can also check their&nbsp;<strong>Answer Key</strong>&nbsp;on our&nbsp;Sarkari Result&nbsp;page or on the official website by using their&nbsp;<strong>Enrollment Number, Registration Number, or Date of Birth</strong>&nbsp;by logging into the&nbsp;<strong>portal.</strong>&nbsp;The&nbsp;<strong>direct link</strong>&nbsp;is provided below.&nbsp;<span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>(Advt No. : 02 Exam 2025</strong></span></span><span style=\"color: #ff0000; font-size: 14pt;\"><b>)</b></span></p>\n<p></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-9849916c\">\n\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p></p>\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n<div class=\"social-buttons\"><!-- WhatsApp Button --> <a class=\"social-button whatsapp\" href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> WhatsApp </a> <!-- Telegram Button --> <a class=\"social-button telegram\" href=\"https://t.me/SarkariExam_info\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"> Telegram </a></div>\n\n\n\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-f58e6ca1\">\n\n<h2 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-2ca5a791 gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Lekhpal&nbsp;Answer Key / Objection Link 2026 – Out</h2>\n\n\n<h3 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-7d5f86e8 gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Lekhpal Examination 2026 : Short Details</h3>\n\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-79adf169 gb-headline-text\"><a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/upsssc-lekhpal-2026/\">SarkariResult.com.cm</a></p>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-303102a8\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-d96c68be\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-d96c68be\">\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-16a90584\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-22b2e02b gb-headline-text\"><strong>Important Dates</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-3b2f0e17 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Start Date : <strong>29 December 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Online Apply Last Date : <strong>28 January 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Last Date For Fee Payment : <strong>28 January</strong><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong> 2026</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Correction Date : <strong>04 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"> Eligibility Result : <strong>26 February 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam Date : <strong>21 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Exam City Details : <strong>11 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Admit Card :&nbsp;<strong>16 May 2026</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Answer Key : <span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>22 May 2026 Available Now</strong></span></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Result Date : <strong>Will Be Updated Here Soon</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates are advised to confirm from the <b>UPSSSC </b>official website.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-fcbb81ff\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-fcbb81ff\">\n\n<h4 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4ddaf9ee gb-headline-text\"><strong>Application Fee</strong></h4>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-989f3ffd gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> General / OBC / EWS : ₹ 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For<strong> SC / ST : ₹ 25</strong><strong>/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">For <strong>PH Candidates</strong>&nbsp;: <strong>₹ 25/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Payment Mode (Online):</strong> You can make the payment using the following methods:</span>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Debit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Credit Card</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Internet Banking</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">IMPS</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Cash Card / Mobile Wallet</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-6b6fbcac\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-wrapper gb-grid-wrapper-8aa46b64\">\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-0f18d865\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-0f18d865\">\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-0b3ada47 gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Lekhpal Notification 2025 : Age Limits As On 01 July 2025</h5>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-28dede61 gb-headline-text\"><ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Minimum Age : <strong>18 Years&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Maximum Age : <strong>40 Years</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>UPSSSC</strong> provides age relaxation for the&nbsp;<strong>Lekhpal</strong>&nbsp;as per their regulations.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div></div>\n\n<div class=\"gb-grid-column gb-grid-column-860b2712\"><div class=\"gb-container gb-container-860b2712\">\n\n<h5 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-f2184b83 gb-headline-text\"><strong>Total Post</strong></h5>\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-4259c0c2 gb-headline-text\">7994 Post</div>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n<div style=\"text-align:center;\">\n<a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri&amp;hl=en_IN\" class=\"apply-button\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\n        Download SarkariResult App Now\n    </a>\n    </div>\n    \n\n</div>\n\n\n\n<!-- SarkariResult -->\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ec1f6e4c\">\n<h6 class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-c7683bda gb-headline-text\">UPSSSC Lekhpal Recruitment 2025 : Vacancy Details</h6>\n\n<div class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-60ccea19 gb-headline-text\"><table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>No. Of Post</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">UPSSSC Lekhpal</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 50%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">7994 Post</span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 116px;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 27px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 31.87%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Post Name</strong></span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.13%; text-align: center; height: 27px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Eligibility Criteria</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr style=\"height: 89px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 31.87%; text-align: center; height: 89px;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">UPSSSC Lekhpal</span></td>\n<td style=\"width: 68.13%; text-align: center; height: 89px;\">\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Candidates must have passed <strong data-start=\"56\" data-end=\"79\">10+2 (Intermediate)</strong> from any <strong data-start=\"89\" data-end=\"118\">recognized board in India</strong> to be eligible.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong><span style=\"color: #800000;\">You May Also Check :</span></strong> <a href=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/railway-icf-trade-apprentice-recruitment-2025/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><strong>Railway ICF Trade Apprentice Recruitment 2025</strong></a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"background-color: #000080; color: #ffffff; font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>&nbsp;How To Check &amp; Download UPSSSC Lekhpal Answer Key 2026&nbsp;</strong></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li data-section-id=\"8b9qze\" data-start=\"69\" data-end=\"153\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Visit the official website of <strong data-start=\"101\" data-end=\"151\"><span class=\"hover:entity-accent entity-underline inline cursor-pointer align-baseline\"><span class=\"whitespace-normal\">Uttar Pradesh Subordinate Services Selection Commission</span></span> (UPSSSC)</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"10y2tan\" data-start=\"154\" data-end=\"224\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Go to the <strong data-start=\"166\" data-end=\"187\">“Candidate Login”</strong> or <strong data-start=\"191\" data-end=\"214\">“Important Notices”</strong> section</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"ud9ija\" data-start=\"225\" data-end=\"286\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on <strong data-start=\"236\" data-end=\"279\">“UPSSSC Lekhpal Answer Key 2026”</strong> link</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"12mfp87\" data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"405\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Enter your:</span>\n<ul data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"405\">\n<li data-section-id=\"14ghz4q\" data-start=\"332\" data-end=\"355\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Registration Number</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1pynuxs\" data-start=\"358\" data-end=\"386\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Date of Birth / Password</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1tbsgx5\" data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"405\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Captcha Code</span></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1llnz3\" data-start=\"406\" data-end=\"435\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Click on <strong data-start=\"417\" data-end=\"435\">Login / Submit</strong></span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"1m1pbjl\" data-start=\"473\" data-end=\"542\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Your allotted <strong data-start=\"489\" data-end=\"514\">Answer Key</strong> will appear on the screen</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"109fg8b\" data-start=\"671\" data-end=\"715\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Download the Answer Key page</span></li>\n<li data-section-id=\"127vuax\" data-start=\"716\" data-end=\"777\"><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\">Take a printout or save.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td